        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSB55NB,  5\" x 5\" x Square Corners Non-Removable Pin for Security and 4 Ball Bearing Solid Brass Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive #12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws,  #12-24 x 1/2\"  machine screws and standard removable button tip finials. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, Non-removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB55NB.jpg?v=1704354539\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S35 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 5 Inch Brass Hinges with Ball Bearings:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Non-Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Quad Ball-Bearing: 4BB</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.145\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB55NB.pdf?v=1704262166\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSB55NB Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\">finishes</a> for this hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't forget to look at <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinge-finials\">Deltana's Brass Hinge Finials</a> to spice up your hinges!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "5 x 5 x Square Corners Solid Brass Hinges with Non-Removable Pin and Ball Bearings, Pair, DSB55NB",
                "description": "Deltana DSB55NB 5 x 5 Solid Brass Hinge, Square Corners, Non Removable Pin with 4 Ball Bearings Hinge. DSB55NB. Heavy Duty 0.145 thick. Package includes a pair of hinges, matching solid brass flathead, Phillips screws and standard removable button tip finials. Available in 10 different finishes",
